><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.07467">RMSNorm (2019)</a><span>, whi=
ch has been a common trend in recent years.</span></p><p>Akin to swapping G=
ELU with Swish and SwiGLU, RMSNorm is one of these smaller but sensible eff=
iciency improvements. RMSNorm is similar to LayerNorm in its purpose to nor=
